      "min_app": "1.004.000",
      "notes": "- Coordinates dialog surfaces, shadows and backdrops when opening and closing, including Credits and small multiplayer windows.\r\n- Remembers the selected HOME game, shortcut and library position while navigating.\r\n- Shows button hints for the action currently available on HOME.\r\n- Keeps long titles scrolling after unrelated input, fades clipped edges and softens the loop restart.\r\n- Gives empty libraries an Open Game files action, hides Go offline when already offline and explains unavailable options.\r\n- Handles covers invalidated by a native rescan without falling back to the built-in launcher."
